<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.3">
<l>cūṭu malarkkuḻalīr tuyarāṭṭiyē ṉaimeliya</l>
<l>pāṭunal vētavoli paravaittirai pōṉmuḻaṅka</l>
<l>māṭuyarn tōmappukai kamaḻuntaṇ ṭiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>nīṭuṟai kiṉṟapirāṉ kaḻalkaṇṭuṅkoṉ ṉiccalumē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You with curls and blossoms to be worn, as misery weakens me, a woman,</l>
<l>will we see for ever the anklet of the lord who long dwelt</l>
<l>in cool Tiruvallavāḻ, where the smoke from the libations spreads fragrance house-high,</l>
<l>while, like the waves of the noisy expanse, the good Vedas they sing thunder?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
